c/texas/hill-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids in Hill County, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 on the middle, June to July ran 225% of normal and September to October ran 61%. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 41% on the middle. Grid 13933 had its driest year in 1954 at 48% of normal.</p>"}
